{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cyberpimp 2069</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From soft launch to full release, bandwidth isn\u2019t the only thing you\u2019ll stretch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/f2384974ba3aa7693db5e0312d8670d7.poster.avif?t=1761231686\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/f2384974ba3aa7693db5e0312d8670d7.webm?t=1761231686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/f2384974ba3aa7693db5e0312d8670d7.mp4?t=1761231686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ultimate Sleaze-Powered Cyber RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cyberpimp 2069</strong>, an erotic open-world RPG that mashes raunchy humor, over-the-top action, and shameless kink into one neon-lit playground. Explore massive 3D districts of glitch cults, black-market bot dens, rooftop raves, and synth-sex arcades in a fully realized cyber-cespool where every alley drips neon, lube, and bad decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Ultimate Digital Degenerate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Gigg A. Loadsprayer</strong>, a disgraced cyber P.I. with an <strong>overclocked libido implant</strong> and a long list of burned bridges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/844ca8fdc2e60cbe9f7a9ce70e739cac.poster.avif?t=1761231686\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/844ca8fdc2e60cbe9f7a9ce70e739cac.webm?t=1761231686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/844ca8fdc2e60cbe9f7a9ce70e739cac.mp4?t=1761231686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madame Glitch\u2014your ex and a pleasure-AI tyrant\u2014seeded fragments of a legendary <strong>climax code</strong> inside your HARD DISK. But your exploits patched the fragments into five vengeful exes. To keep the Grid from melting into one endless moan, and get back into Glitch\u2019s deep drive, you\u2019ll have to fight, flirt, and hustle those shards back\u2026 or watch the Vice Grid drown in infinite climax.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seduce the Lovers of the Grid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win over\u2014or survive\u2014five unforgettable women, each with her own pleasures, grudges, and end-of-the-world kinks. Each ex is a walking weapon of temptation and revenge. Every encounter, a mix of combat, seduction, and fully animated erotic chaos.:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/49c4b4008d0a2d61d79a900f6b7088a9.avif?t=1761231686\" width=350 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAMona Bang</strong> \u2013 Erotic memory surgeon splicing brains and grudges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/7e426a55d0fe5c6119d178590a2a8790.avif?t=1761231686\" width=350 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Kitty Overclock</strong> \u2013 Rave goddess dropping stimwaves harder than your last breakup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/b33362ed7f391f7086db3b2f7fa23a78.avif?t=1761231686\" width=350 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Selena Stream</strong> \u2013 Neuro-porn mogul turning every mistake into metrics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/fd1359c2b7122b7fbb9ebeb19d27c790.avif?t=1761231686\" width=350 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ci-Ci TV</strong> \u2013 Voyeur queen broadcasting your every bad decision in 4K.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/1517bb35acec898b2702153cb0436e8c.avif?t=1761231686\" width=350 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trixie Geargrind</strong> \u2013 Pleasure-bot engineer who\u2019d rather rebuild you as scrap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charm them, fight for them, or both\u2014every choice pushes the story deeper into dangerous, fully animated mature encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Partners in Grime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cyber-freak survives the Vice Grid alone\u2014especially not a washed-up scuzz bucket with a malfunctioning rig.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/334320788f8b62ad6b4c12d96f225bae.avif?t=1761231686\" width=350 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chassis Rae</strong> \u2013 Sharp-tongued grease queen who patches wounds, hot-wires rides, and upgrades anything\u2014sometimes Gigg, though she\u2019ll deny still wanting a piece of him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/16d27fac8ab2c957851bc3d109da9305.avif?t=1761231686\" width=350 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Croch Rott</strong> \u2013 A stim-soaked alley rat and black-market savant. He can find or forge anything. Loyal, lethal, and drunk enough to follow Gigg anywhere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast, Filthy Action</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast creeps &amp; glitch degenerates</strong> in high-octane street fights and shootouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack, craft &amp; upgrade</strong> sleazy gadgets with parts scavenged from junkyards and back-alley clinics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seduction showdowns</strong> where raunchy dialogue and timing are as lethal as bullets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/83a7852e1386faa3d174feaa1f026db6.poster.avif?t=1761231686\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/83a7852e1386faa3d174feaa1f026db6.webm?t=1761231686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/extras/83a7852e1386faa3d174feaa1f026db6.mp4?t=1761231686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cyber City That Never Closes Its Legs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in a <strong>smut-soaked megasprawl</strong>, a steamy labyrinth where alleys reek of synth-sweat and cheap thrills. Every block is a trap baited with neon lust and whispered crimes. The air is thick with oil smoke and pheromones. Steam curls from cracked grates as holo-ads flicker over grease-slick pavement, each doorway promising data, debauchery, or a knife in the ribs. The city pulses like a broken heart\u2014streets wet, loud, and hungry, alive with hustlers, black-market implants, and endless offers you can\u2019t afford to refuse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explicit, high-resolution erotic scenes tied directly to quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching storylines packed with betrayal, romance, and unholy alliances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep action-RPG combat mixed with seduction and crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A comic-book-loud, unrepentantly filthy cyberpunk world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpimp 2069</strong> is where pleasure is currency, danger is foreplay, and the only safe word is \u201crespawn.\u201d</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047180?t=1761231686","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047180?t=1761231686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/b54e230c96a518c121c4f644deee8c76d36c4901/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761231686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047180/b54e230c96a518c121c4f644deee8c76d36c4901/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761231686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is intended for adults (18+) only and includes:\r\n\u2022 explicit and frequent nudity\r\n\u2022 sexual dialog and scenes/scenarios\r\n\u2022 oral, vaginal, anal penetrative and non-penetrative acts\r\n\u2022 Female Penetration, Ejaculation, Full Nudity\r\n\u2022 All characters depicted are over the age of 18."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>C